// How JsonDiff identifies objects inside arrays, so reordered or edited elements still line up, and which object
// members it leaves out of the comparison.
//
// "ArrayKeys" -- without rules, array elements are aligned by content like a text diff.
//
// Each rule in "ArrayKeys" has:
//   "Key"   paths to the values that identify an object; objects with equal values are matched.
//   "When"  optional conditions (path -> value, or path -> [alternatives]) that must all hold for the rule to apply.
//           A rule without "When" applies to objects that have at least one of its key values.
// For each object the first rule that applies wins. Objects with equal keys are paired in order of appearance.
//
// Paths are property names separated by dots. "[field=value]" after an array property selects the element whose
// "field" is the string "value", e.g. Fields[Name=Id].Value.
//
// "IgnoreKeys" -- members that are shown dimmed and never count as a difference. Each rule is either a property
// name, ignored in every object at any depth, or an object with:
//   "Keys"  property names to ignore.
//   "When"  optional conditions as above; the names are only ignored in objects where all of them hold.
//
// To customize, copy this file to %APPDATA%\JsonDiff\MatchRules.json; that copy takes precedence.
// File > Reload rereads the rules.
//
// Example:
//
// {
//   "ArrayKeys": [
//     {
//       // Sensors and cameras carry their identifier in a nested field: { "Type": "Sensor", "Fields": [ { "Name": "Id", "Value": "s1" } ] }
//       "When": { "Type": [ "Sensor", "Camera" ] },
//       "Key": [ "Type", "Fields[Name=Id].Value" ]
//     },
//     {
//       // Exists only once.
//       "When": { "Type": "Clock" },
//       "Key": [ "Type" ]
//     },
//     {
//       // Everything else that has a Type or a Name.
//       "Key": [ "Type", "Name" ]
//     }
//   ],
//   "IgnoreKeys": [
//     // Changes on every save.
//     "Timestamp",
//     {
//       // Only meaningful for sensors.
//       "When": { "Type": "Sensor" },
//       "Keys": [ "Revision" ]
//     }
//   ]
// }
{
  "ArrayKeys": [],
  "IgnoreKeys": []
}
